    { "id": "task-points", "score": 22.5, "max": 30, "comment": "The reason (\"В пятницу я работаю допоздна\"), the day (\"в субботу\") and the time (\"в три часа дня\") are all clear. The place is missing completely, so one of the four units is lost." },
    { "id": "task-length", "score": 10, "max": 15, "comment": "Only 3 real sentences, not counting the greeting, against a minimum of 5. Short is acceptable for a message, but here it was too short to fit the place." },
    { "id": "letter-form", "score": 10, "max": 10, "comment": "There is a friendly greeting (\"Привет, Алина!\") and a natural chat register with consistent ты. It ends with a fitting closing request (\"Напиши, если тебе удобно\")." },
    { "id": "vocabulary", "score": 18, "max": 20, "comment": "Everyday vocabulary is used accurately and idiomatically (\"допоздна\", \"предлагаю встретиться\", \"удобно\"). The range is naturally narrow because the text is so short." },
    { "id": "grammar", "score": 23, "max": 25, "comment": "There are no errors: time expressions with в + accusative are correct, and the connectors поэтому and если are used well. The variety is limited, with no past or future forms, because the text is brief." }
  ],
  "corrected": "Привет, Алина! В пятницу я работаю допоздна, поэтому предлагаю встретиться в субботу. Давай в три часа дня? Напиши, если тебе удобно.",
  "changes": [],
  "tips": [
    "Always check that every unit of the task is covered. Here you forgot the place, e.g. \"Давай встретимся в кафе около метро\".",
    "Reach the required number of sentences (5). Add one or two simple ones, e.g. \"Там очень вкусный кофе. Я буду ждать тебя у входа.\"",
    "Use a future form to show more range at A2, e.g. \"Мы погуляем в парке\" or \"Я позвоню тебе вечером\"."
  ]
